        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A03-R2410, 4 Inch x 10 Inch Classic Floor Air Register</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4 Inch x 10 Inch Classic Floor Air Register has a damper that allows you to adjust the airflow to the room. It is easy to install in an existing or new 4 inch x 10 inch floor opening. The geometric design is fancy while still managing to have a transitional feel. The Classic 4 Inch x 10 Inch Register with Damper is available beautiful finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Also Available Matching:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"/products/classic-4-inch-x-12-inch-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r2412\"<b>4 Inch x 12 Inch Classic Floor Register</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/classic-4-inch-x-14-inch-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r2414\"<b>4 Inch x 14 Inch Classic Floor Register</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Classic 4 Inch x 10 Inch Brass Register:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Damper Box to control the airflow.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Brass Accents Floor Air Register is designed to fit snugly into ducts. When determining the size of register you require, measure the opening in the floor and not the overall size of any existing registers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BRA-reg-finishes.jpg?v=1704354502\" width=\"566\" height=\"139\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Brass Accents Register Finishes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
